Subject: CPMS I02B Direction-Aware Generation Activation

Description: Active signature for a pure feature-gated in-memory generator that forms two bounded direction-isolated definition universes and root drafts without publishing canonical documents.

@ [specification_uuid] f29fc0e7-dc27-4288-a0bd-dded8409bd98
@ [profile] cantor-cpms-i02b-activation/0.1
@ [satisfaction_signature_uuid] c9d56c09-99da-42f3-a110-c41db47345ff
@ [source_manifest] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-08-05_cpms_i02b_generation\Source_Document_Manifest.sop
@ [prerequisite_commit] f946396

& [InputAuthority] is exact
  + use only existing json-schema capability, serde_json, standard ordered collections, and cantor_core sha256_bytes
  + add no dependency and change no core, CLI, MCP, service, ecosystem, Windows, provider, or runtime source

& [DirectionAuthority] is isolated
  + generate prepare, run, and verify roots under Deserialize
  + generate base-response and preparation-response identities under Serialize
  + use a fresh generator per root and merge only within equal direction
  + equal name and unequal normalized definition bytes fails closed

& [NormalizationAuthority] is generated values only
  + recursive scalar-preserving compact JSON with object keys sorted by Unicode scalar sequence and array order retained
  + split $defs before root normalization and merge normalized definitions lexically
  + no byte parser or duplicate-key claim

& [ClosureAuthority] is local cycle-safe graph accounting
  + every reference is #/$defs/<stable-name> and resolves in the same universe
  + visited and active sets bound traversal
  + direct self cycles are ProcedureType and ProcedureValue only
  + unresolved external relative cross-direction and unexpected mutual cycles fault without partial release

& [BoundsAuthority] uses exact profile 0.1 defaults
  + document bytes 4194304, bundle bytes 16777216, definitions 256, references 4096, depth 64, object properties 4096, alternatives 2048, residuals 1024, corpus cases 4096, corpus bytes 67108864
  + root depth is zero, object or array children increment, properties entries count, and enum oneOf anyOf allOf entries count as alternatives
  + caller may lower but never raise defaults

& [FingerprintAuthority] is domain separated
  + definition, root, and universe profiles use zero-separated unambiguous preimages
  + universe binds generator schemars/1.2.2, supplied lowercase 40-or-64 hex source revision, exact limits, ordered child fingerprints, and measured account
  + opposite directions retain distinct fingerprints even when raw bytes match

& [PublicSurface] is feature gated and pure
  + closed serializable data forms, generate_contract_definition_universe, and atomic generate_public_procedure_schema_universes
  + no result is described as canonical document, compatibility baseline, validation, semantic proof, authority, or production release

& [SourceTouch] is closed
  + modify tool lib.rs and add schema_generation.rs and machine_schema_generation.rs only
  + governance and metadata-only evidence records may accompany completion

& [Gates] are complete
  + focused deterministic direction closure recursion limit collision source-revision and atomic-failure tests
  + default and feature debug release offline tests, all-feature check lint build docs, audit, diff, byte compatibility, and evidence freshness

& [AuthorityLimit] is I02B only
  - never: I02C document materialization or goldens, I03 parser or validator, I04 tool definitions, provider, model, service, persistence, network, effect, production, or hardware

